{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から\n16th握手会が始まりました！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、ミニライブレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう一目見て気づくのは\n会場の広さね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブの時点で\n2万人超だとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがたい限りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\nサヨナラの意味\nブランコ\n-MC-\nあの教室\n２度目のキスから\n君に贈る花がない\nないものねだり\n-MC-\n孤独な青空"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初披露の曲がたくさん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンエトを披露できる機会は\n今のところ全握だけだから\n本当に貴重ですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの声には\nお応えしたいんだけどもね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手券のシステムが変わったのに\nミニライブにもたくさんの方が来てくださって\n嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと一緒のレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと同じレーンって初めてかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやの握手会ってどんな感じか\n知らなかったけど\nまあやらしさ全開でめっちゃ好き！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞き間違えしたり、\nまあや流の英語で話してたり、\n成り立ってるのか不思議な会話をしてたり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"受け答えが面白くて\n笑いの絶えない握手会でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/11/23/9937600/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}